# .gitignore for .NET projects (Visual Studio, Rider, VS Code)

## Build artifacts
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## Dependency directories
packages/
*.nupkg

## IDE and user-specific files
# Rider (.idea)
.idea/
*.iml
**/.name
modules.xml
workspace.xml

# ReSharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# VS Code
.vscode/

## Other generated files
*.log
TestResult/
*.VisualState.xml

## OS-generated files
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

## ops self 
NpOn.sln.DotSettings.user
*.user

## Logs
**/logs/
**/proto/

# Bỏ qua các file image nén của Rancher/K8s
*.tar.gz

## Allow Agent & Harness framework files (DO NOT IGNORE)
!AGENTS.md
!agents.md
!.agents/
!.agents/**

## Ignore timestamped & history benchmark / report runs (keep only clean latest & summary)
.agents/benchmarks/*_*_*.md
.agents/reports/harness_*_*.md
!.agents/benchmarks/benchmark_100runs_summary.md
!.agents/benchmarks/dapper_vs_udal_latest.md
!.agents/reports/harness_latest.md

!CLAUDE.md
!.claude/
!.claude/**
